== Checklist ==
: ''See also: [[Zimel's Blades (SoulFire)]]
Note, you will want Warmly faction with Bloodsabers before turnin to Lord Grimrot, Heretics before turn in to Jotayi Ibupran, etc.

If you click your burning soul, and it still gives you text, you have not completed the turn in likely due to faction issues.{{CheckboxList}}
* Prepare these items first!
** Obtain a [[SoulFire]]
** Obtain a [[Dark Reaver]]
* Slay [[Brother Hayle]]
** Loot and click on soul
* Find [[Lord Grimrot]] - MUST BE LIVING VERSION!
** Give Lord Grimrot [[Dark Reaver]] and clicked [[Burning Soul of the Pious]] - requires [[Bloodsabers]] Kindly Faction
** Kill Lord Grimrot
* Find [[Jotayi Ibupran]] in [[Paineel]]
** Give Jotayi Ibupran [[Pestilence Scythe]] (with charges, not uncharged) and [[Burning Soul of the Pestilent]] - requires [[Heretics]] Warmly Faction
* Find [[Inte Akera]]
** Give [[Dason Goldblade]] 500pp to spawn Inte Akera -- '''Doing so will spawn Inte Akera in the Windmill on Island 4. Inte is a Deepwater Knight of Prexus and will unleash the Oceanlord's fury upon those deemed 'evil' in their eyes. Inte Akera only stays up for a few minutes, so hustle.'''
**  Kill [[Inte Akera]] and loot the [[Burning Soul of the Virtuous]]. ''Note: If you are in a group, the the soul is linked to who turns in the 500 platinum to spawn Inte.''
*  Give [[Luxio Nulsis]] in East Freeport the three souls and [[Soulfire]]. Requires [[Dismal Rage]] kindly faction!
{{End}}

== Walkthrough ==

;Burning Soul of the Pious

;Burning Soul of the Pestilent
*Next part requires [[Bloodsabers]] Kindly Faction.
**You can gain [[Bloodsabers]] faction by doing the [[Guard Shilster's Stout]] quest. Give 5 gold at a time to [[Guard Shilster]] (1380, -2764) in [[Northern Plains of Karana|North Karana]]. Takes about ~3000 gold to max out.
*Find [[Lord Grimrot]] (1377, 1172) by the skeletons in [[South Karana]]. There's a living and undead version with the same name. '''The turn in requires the living version.''' It's rumored to be a 3.2 hour spawn. One of the fastest ways to spawn Lord Grimrot is to make an instance right at 6am. Use <code><nowiki>/time</nowiki></code> to see the in-game time.
*Turn in the clicked version of [[Burning Soul of the Pious]] and [[Dark Reaver]] to the living version of Lord Grimrot.
**:Lord Grimrot says, 'You have served me well. You may yet prove useful to my master.'
